{"blocks":[["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7424","Impact of past success cases:",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7460","\"it wasn't really a slam dunk to give the agent access to prior success cases\"",["Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences","Impact of past success cases:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7546","\"in many cases, it seemed like the agent would slip into a local minima and kind of just like pattern match and get lazy\"",["Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences","Impact of past success cases:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7675","\"Oh, you already gave me the answer. Thank you. I'll just say that back\"",["Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences","Impact of past success cases:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7755","Community approach needed:",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7788","\"it's important to create a community around this idea of context engineering so we can all solve these problems together\"",["Video","08:49 Learning from Past Experiences","Community approach needed:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7918","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-7983","Importance of compaction:",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8015","\"compaction is a really important point of leverage\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Importance of compaction:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8075","\"how do you distill down for the next turn of the model compassion is so important\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Importance of compaction:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8166","Current approaches don't work well:",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8208","\"today's approaches don't really work\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Current approaches don't work well:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8254","\"the difference between no summary and the compaction coming out of like open code for example is negligible\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Current approaches don't work well:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8371","\"you can basically throw away that compaction entirely\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Current approaches don't work well:"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8434","Better compaction with improved prompts:",["Context Engineering for Engineers - YouTube","Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges"]],["Person/Jeff%20Huber/YouTube/25/08/Context%20Engineering%20for%20Engineers/","source-block-8481","\"if you do a smarter compaction with a better prompt it can be much better\"",["Video","09:39 Context Compaction Challenges","Better compaction with improved prom